{"n": 83, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "83.webp", "text": "11-14/42.8\n\nif applicable, remove tensioning rail.\n\nPull sprocket off of crankshaft.\nLift-out woodruff key.\n\nif applicable, remove reversing roller.\n\nNote:\nThe reversing roller can only be\nreplaced complete with bearings.\n\nLowering Ol! Pan;\nUnscrew bolts and take off lower ol!\npan\n\nInstallation:\nReplace gasket.\nTightening torque = 9 Nm (6.5 ft. Ibs.).\n\nUnscrew bolts and lower oll pan up to\nthe front axle carrier.\n\nInstallation:\nReplace gasket.\nFill In Joints between the front timing\n\nInstallation:\nDon't install the gasket inversed.\n\n** Source of Supply: HWB", "words": [["11-14/42.8", 0.4732, 0.0318, 0.5836, 0.057], ["if", 0.2756, 0.0703, 0.2842, 0.0908], ["applicable,", 0.2872, 0.0729, 0.3455, 0.0875], ["remove", 0.349, 0.0749, 0.3891, 0.0849], ["tensioning", 0.3926, 0.0736, 0.4483, 0.0882], ["rail.", 0.4519, 0.0736, 0.4716, 0.0855], ["Pull", 0.2746, 0.3031, 0.2979, 0.3243], ["sprocket", 0.3004, 0.3057, 0.4422, 0.321], ["off", 0.3501, 0.3031, 0.3652, 0.3243], ["of", 0.3703, 0.3031, 0.3799, 0.3243], ["crankshaft.", 0.385, 0.3057, 0.4422, 0.321], ["Lift-out", 0.2751, 0.3196, 0.3156, 0.3408], ["woodruff", 0.3207, 0.3196, 0.3658, 0.3408], ["key.", 0.3708, 0.3196, 0.3921, 0.3408], ["if", 0.2766, 0.5378, 0.2832, 0.5497], ["applicable,", 0.2867, 0.5385, 0.3445, 0.5531], ["remove", 0.3485, 0.5411, 0.3875, 0.5504], ["reversing", 0.3911, 0.5385, 0.4412, 0.5531], ["roller.", 0.4448, 0.5385, 0.4757, 0.5504], ["Note:", 0.2771, 0.7712, 0.304, 0.7832], ["The", 0.2761, 0.7871, 0.2969, 0.7997], ["reversing", 0.2999, 0.7878, 0.3506, 0.8024], ["roller", 0.3541, 0.7878, 0.3825, 0.7997], ["can", 0.385, 0.7905, 0.4043, 0.7997], ["only", 0.4078, 0.7878, 0.4311, 0.8024], ["be", 0.4347, 0.7878, 0.4473, 0.7997], ["replaced", 0.2766, 0.8037, 0.3242, 0.819], ["complete", 0.3262, 0.8031, 0.3749, 0.8196], ["with", 0.3779, 0.8044, 0.4007, 0.8163], ["bearings.", 0.4043, 0.8044, 0.4529, 0.819], ["Lowering", 0.7